### Login (form fields, OAuth2 password flow) -> the token is saved in {{token}}
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin@altranodes.example&password=ChangeMe-2026!

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Who am I?
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without token -> 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices/list

### Create an operator and a viewer (admin only)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "giulia.ferri@serrebellini.example",
  "full_name": "Giulia Ferri",
  "password": "Agronoma-2026!",
  "role": "operator"
}

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "operaio@serrebellini.example",
  "full_name": "Operaio serra 3",
  "password": "Operaio-2026!",
  "role": "viewer"
}

### Register a sensor (admin)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serial": "SH-000123",
  "name": "Serra 3 - sonda nord",
  "device_class": "sensor",
  "site": "Sezze"
}

> {% client.global.set("device_id", response.body.data.id); %}

### Login as viewer -> token saved in {{viewer_token}}
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=operaio@serrebellini.example&password=Operaio-2026!

> {% client.global.set("viewer_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### The viewer can read...
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices/{{device_id}}/config
Authorization: Bearer {{viewer_token}}

### ...but cannot change the configuration -> 403
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices/{{device_id}}/config
Authorization: Bearer {{viewer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1,
  "min_temp": 12,
  "max_temp": 28,
  "sampling_sec": 30
}

### Latest telemetry samples (start simulator/simulator.py SH-000123 first)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices/{{device_id}}/readings?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change the configuration while the device is offline, then restart the simulator
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices/{{device_id}}/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1,
  "min_temp": 15,
  "max_temp": 26,
  "sampling_sec": 5
}

### Device list: online, reported_version, desired_version, in_sync
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/devices/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
